      <guid>linux.do-topic-2261369</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 28 May 2026 08:30:01 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>
            &lt;p&gt;前两天参考 &lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/2208328&quot;&gt;https://linux.do/t/topic/2208328&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://linux.do/t/topic/2235533&quot;&gt;https://linux.do/t/topic/2235533&lt;/a&gt; 两位佬的帖子，成功薅到windsurf200刀额度。&lt;br&gt;
